{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/c3b7271ed5c286929511882c627357e9.avif?t=1772982047\" width=864 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>A cozy relaxing farming sim with a cute simplistic art style with vibrant colors, characters, and classic gameplay.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape the noise of city life and start over on a colorful tropical island full of secrets and possibilities.<br>With a cute minimalist art style, vibrant colors, and relaxing classic gameplay, <i>Sunset Sprout</i> offers a peaceful <strong>farming and life simulation</strong> experience for players who love <i>cozy games</i>, <i>crafting</i>, and <i>island adventures</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/4ca598a40a65758e4eb5635d7678877d.poster.avif?t=1772982047\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/4ca598a40a65758e4eb5635d7678877d.webm?t=1772982047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/4ca598a40a65758e4eb5635d7678877d.mp4?t=1772982047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After realizing your 9\u20135 job isn\u2019t making you happy, you decide to make a change \u2014 to become a farmer!<br>In the southern seas of Kur, you discover an oddly affordable island for sale. You put everything on the line \u2014 your savings, your car, and even most of your clothes \u2014 to buy it and start fresh on the <strong>Island of Sunset Sprout</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your dream farm, meet new friends, uncover the island\u2019s mysteries, and become part of its close-knit <strong>community</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i><u>Deliver Orders</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/b90179c5a06ed82a246e300283c20e91.poster.avif?t=1772982047\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/b90179c5a06ed82a246e300283c20e91.webm?t=1772982047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/b90179c5a06ed82a246e300283c20e91.mp4?t=1772982047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf3e <strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3b 34+ unique plants and trees to grow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc11 7+ types of adorable animals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe1 12+ buildings and full farm expansions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf26\ufe0f Seasons, day\u2013night cycle, and dynamic weather effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udded A full main questline with character stories and island secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddfa 50+ crafting recipes to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f Visit your friends\u2019 islands and explore together</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Full controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc96 Cozy, relaxing gameplay designed for comfort and creativity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026and so much more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i><u>Craft Items</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/536ebc6d625221e01884b71b57d2f9a5.poster.avif?t=1772982047\" width=910 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/536ebc6d625221e01884b71b57d2f9a5.webm?t=1772982047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615490/extras/536ebc6d625221e01884b71b57d2f9a5.mp4?t=1772982047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant, harvest, and manage your crops. Care for animals, decorate your home, and help rebuild the island.<br>Whether you\u2019re tending your fields, exploring for hidden treasures, or chatting with the locals, <i>Sunset Sprout</i> offers a relaxing <strong>cozy farming sim</strong> experience perfect for fans of <i>Stardew Valley</i>, <i>Harvest Moon</i>, and <i>Animal Crossing</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i><u>And so much more!</u></i></strong></p><p class=\